<h1>#{title}
<p>
  The key to building a successful team in Naruto Unison is choosing ninjas whose abilities work well together.
<h2>Chakra Generation
<p>
  Almost all skills cost chakra, and more powerful skills typically cost more chakra. These ninjas can generate chakra or steal it from the opposing team, making it easier for allies to use their most powerful skills.
<details>
  <summary>
    View ninjas
  ^{character "Choji Akimichi" Original}
  ^{character "Inoichi Yamanaka" Original}
  ^{character "Minato Namikaze" Original}
  ^{character "Orochimaru" Original}
  ^{character "Young Kakashi" Original}
  ^{character "Preta Path Pain" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Sage Mode Kabuto" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Sai" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Shino Aburame" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Tsunade" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Zetsu" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Nagato" Reanimated}
<h2>Cooldown Reduction
<p>
  Cooldown reduction is a rare ability that shortens the active cooldowns of instant skills, meaning they can be used more often. These ninjas can reduce or reset the cooldowns of their allies.
<details>
  <summary>View ninjas
  ^{character "Kakashi Hatake" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Sage Mode Kabuto" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Hashirama Senju" Reanimated}
<h2>Countering
<p>
  To counter a skill means to negate its effects, and optionally retaliate against its user. These ninjas can protect their team from skills by apply countering effects to allies or enemies.
<details>
