<h2>Invulnerability
<p>
  Invulnerability is a status effect that blocks harmful skills for a set number of turns. Ninjas with invulnerability cannot be targeted by enemies. These ninjas can protect their team from skills by applying invulnerability to their allies.
<details>
  <summary>View ninjas
