  ^{character "Tobirama Senju" Reanimated}
<h2>Redirection
<p>
  Redirection is a rare status effect that causes the effects of harmful skills to be redirected to other targets. These ninjas can protect their team from skills by applying redirection to their allies.
<details>
  <summary>View ninjas
  ^{character "Asuma Sarutobi" Original}
  ^{character "Hiashi Hyuga" Original}
  ^{character "Kakashi Hatake" Original}
  ^{character "Misumi Tsurugi" Original}
  ^{character "Yondaime Minato" Original}
  ^{character "Jiraiya" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Puppet Master Kankuro" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Tenten" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Zetsu" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Minato Namikaze" Reanimated}
  ^{character "Gengetsu Hozuki" Reanimated}
  ^{character "Sasori" Reanimated}
<h2>Sensing
<p>
  Sensing is a rare status effect that reveals invisible effects and skill cooldowns of enemy ninjas. These ninjas can apply sensing to their enemies, making it easier to strategize against them and avoid triggering traps.
<details>
  <summary>View ninjas
  ^{character "Fu Yamanaka" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Human Path Pain" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Ino Yamanaka" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Nagato" Reanimated}
<h2>Status Curing
<p>
  Certain status effects can be removed by skills. These ninjas can support their team by removing harmful status effects from them.
<details>
  <summary>View ninjas
  ^{character "Rin Nohara" Original}
  ^{character "Shizune" Original}
  ^{character "Chiyo" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Kabuto Yakushi" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Kakashi Hatake" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Sage Mode Kabuto" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Sakura Haruno" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Tobi" Shippuden}
<h2>Status Prevention
<p>
  Status prevention is a rare status effect that blocks other effects, either by disabling active effects or by preventing new status effects from being applied to the target. These ninjas can protect their team from negative status effects.
<details>
  <summary>View ninjas
  ^{character "Baki" Original}
  ^{character "Haku" Original}
  ^{character "Dodai" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Ino Yamanaka" Shippuden}
